{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8c594768-77ae-8683-b704-0243e7c023fb",
  "created_at": "2026-01-09T13:49:13-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Thomas Burdick",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:46:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:46:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good afternoon. Pardon me, I'm calling about the trash and recycling pickup. Can you hear me all right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:46:38-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:46:42-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I wanted to ask about the new schedule after the holiday week. My pickup got thrown off, and I'm not sure which day it is now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:46:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. What street are you on, or what day was your pickup normally?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:47:00-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Pardon me, I'd rather not give the address if that's all right. It's normally Friday. Today, actually."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:47:07-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, no problem. So your regular day is Friday. With the holidays, collection ran a day behind for a stretch. It should be back on the normal day now. But with the coastal storm coming in today, they may delay or skip some routes, so I'd put the bins out and watch for an announcement."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:47:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. So it's back to Friday, but today might not happen because of the storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:47:36-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. If it doesn't get picked up today, it would likely roll to the next collection day. Leave it by the curb, but secure the lid if you can, with the wind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:47:50-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, all right. Pardon me, one more thing. My recycling bin has a cracked side, and the lid won't close. How do I request a replacement?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:48:01-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We can take that request here. I'll note that it's a recycling bin with a cracked side and a lid that won't close. I'll need the service address for the delivery, though."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:48:14-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. Pardon me. I see. Could I call back with that? I'm out right now, and I don't have the information in front of me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:48:25-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. Just call this department back and ask for a bin replacement. Have the address ready, and say whether it's the recycling or trash bin. Do you want a callback number noted in case we get disconnected?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:48:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. It's four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-three."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:48:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-three. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:48:46-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I should get going. I have to pick up a rug that was being cleaned, and I want to get there before the weather turns."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:48:57-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's smart. Roads can get messy fast in these coastal storms. Anything else I can help with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:49:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's everything. Pardon me, and thank you for your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:49:09-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Burdick. Stay safe out there."
    }
  ],
